### Get current password policy (public, no auth)
GET {{host}}/password/policy
Content-Type: application/json
x-Version: {{x-version}}

### Validate a password against the configured policy (public, no auth)
POST {{host}}/password/validate
Content-Type: application/json
x-Version: {{x-version}}

{
  "password": "aaa",
  "confirmPassword": "aaa",
  "userName": "super.admin",
  "email": "super.admin@example.com"
}
